Title: Fire breaks out in fields close to Guildford
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'A spokesperson', 'Text': 'the fire broke out in fields adjacent to Piccards Farm House.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 26, 'EndChar': 73}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Some 10 fire crews are attempting to put out a large blaze in fields near a Surrey town.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 74}}, {'Description': 'Surrey Fire & Rescue Service was called at 16:20 BST on Monday to the blaze in the Sandy Lane area of Guildford.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 76, 'EndChar': 168}}, {'Description': 'No properties were damaged in the blaze, the service confirmed.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 56}}, {'Description': 'Residents in the area have been advised to keep windows and doors closed because of smoke.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 80}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Close up image of the front of a fire engine'}]}
